@gateway = http://localhost:8080
@notification = http://localhost:8082

### 演示用户登录
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo",
  "password": "Demo@123456"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.data.accessToken);
%}

### 管理员登录
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin@123456"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.data.accessToken);
%}

### 查询商品
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/products

### 查询活动
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/campaigns

> {%
    client.global.set("campaignId", response.body.data[0].id);
%}

### 查询我的收货地址
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/addresses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

> {%
    client.global.set("addressId", response.body.data[0].id);
%}

### 新增收货地址
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/addresses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipientName": "张三",
  "phone": "13800000000",
  "province": "上海市",
  "city": "上海市",
  "district": "浦东新区",
  "detailAddress": "张江路 1 号 101 室",
  "postalCode": "201210",
  "defaultAddress": true
}

### 创建订单（重复执行时保持相同 Idempotency-Key 可验证幂等）
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/campaigns/{{campaignId}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-request-00000001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 1,
  "addressId": {{addressId}}
}

> {%
    client.global.set("orderNo", response.body.data.orderNo);
%}

### 查询我的订单
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 查询指定订单
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderNo}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 模拟支付
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderNo}}/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 管理员发货
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/admin/orders/{{orderNo}}/ship
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "carrier": "顺丰速运",
  "trackingNo": "SF1234567890"
}

### 用户确认收货
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderNo}}/receive
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 查看用户站内通知（notification-service 内部接口）
GET {{notification}}/internal/notifications?userId=1

### 强制重建活动 Redis 库存（管理员）
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/admin/campaigns/{{campaignId}}/warmup
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 只读检查 Redis 与 MySQL 库存是否一致（管理员）
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/admin/inventory/reconciliation
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 立即执行一次库存对账；同一漂移需在静默窗口内保持不变才会被 CAS 修复（管理员）
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/admin/inventory/reconciliation
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 查看库存修复审计日志（管理员）
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/admin/inventory/reconciliation/logs
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 查看 Redis 库存补偿任务（管理员）
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/admin/inventory/compensations
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 手动重试耗尽重试次数的补偿任务（管理员）
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/admin/inventory/compensations/1/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
